        "subject": "LU-16518 lnet: avoid non-literal format string",
        "message": "LU-16518 lnet: avoid non-literal format string\n\nPass the string returned by ln_routing2str() through a \"%s\"\nformat specifier rather than using it as the format string\nitself. This fixes a -Wformat-security warning.\n\nFixes: 7fb531928dae (\"LU-15135 lnet: Add defines for state of routing\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I07c5f1cc6f0e94c270fd6dad85eddd686ce14d38\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67349\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nReviewed-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
